  "question": {
    "text": "For the reaction:<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math><br />The correct statement(s) in the balanced equation is/are:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Stoichiometric coefficient of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>  is 6.",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Iodide is oxidized.",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Sulphur is reduced.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>  is one of the products.",
      "is_correct": true
