  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The balanced equation is,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Here, in this reaction,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>HSO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math>&nbsp;is in one of the products, and by balancing the reaction, we get its stiochiometric coefficient as 6.</p><p>Oxidation number of iodine in reactant side is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and it is oxidised to&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>with</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;oxidation number in product side.</p>"
  }
}